    its a dish prepared for this town since before you were born!!","parentUIDs":[9],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Dario","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":12}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":20,"yPos":256},"ID":11,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"But
    its too predicable!!","parentUIDs":[10],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Dino","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":13},{"__type":"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":14},{"__type":"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":15}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":-67,"yPos":355},"ID":12,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Calm
    down guys.","parentUIDs":[11],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Leondardo","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":17}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":-50,"yPos":508},"ID":16,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Well
    its hard to let go because father taught us this recipe...","parentUIDs":[15],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Dario","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":18}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":186,"yPos":575},"ID":17,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"He
    taught us to cook with courage. I think you''re afraid to let him go. ","parentUIDs":[16],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Dino","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":19}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":453,"yPos":495},"ID":18,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"I
    haven''t forgotten that. But I feel like you''re trying to erase him completely.
    ","parentUIDs":[17],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Dario","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":20}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":587,"yPos":390},"ID":19,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"I
    never thought about it like that...","parentUIDs":[18],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Dino","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":21},{"__type":"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":22},{"__type":"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":23}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":749,"yPos":486},"ID":20,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"*Whispers*\nWe
    are finally getting somwhere!","parentUIDs":[19],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Leonardo","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":25}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":1033,"yPos":660},"ID":24,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Why
    don''t you try each others food since it is something that connects you. Maybe
    you can learn alot from it.","parentUIDs":[23],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"You","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":27}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":865,"yPos":762},"ID":25,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Dino
    tries Dario''s Bruschetta.\nDario tries Dino''s Pan Fried Polenta. ","parentUIDs":[24],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":null,"OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":28}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":614,"yPos":852},"ID":27,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Wow...
    This tastes like home. ","parentUIDs":[25],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Dino","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":29}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":875,"yPos":918},"ID":28,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Wow...
    This is really good. It kind of tastes like how dad used to make it. ","parentUIDs":[27],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Dario","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":31}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":1127,"yPos":794},"ID":29,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"It
    is! I only  changed his recipe slightly. I never wanted to fully erase him. ","parentUIDs":[28],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Dino","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":32}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":1354,"yPos":695},"ID":31,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"I''m
    sorry for getting so angry with you. I had the completely wrong idea. ","parentUIDs":[29],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Dario","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":33}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":1584,"yPos":646},"ID":32,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"And
    I''m sorry too. I didn''t notice how much my words hurt you. ","parentUIDs":[31],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Dino
    ","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":34}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":1607,"yPos":783},"ID":33,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"The
